      <h2>A removal service built around older people, not just a van</h2>
      <p>A standard removal firm turns up on the day with a van and a crew. For many older people that is not enough: the sorting, the packing, the paperwork and the first week in the new home are where the stress really sits. Chayce Properties treats the removal as one step in a managed move, with one coordinator looking after everything before and after the lorry arrives.</p>
      <p>Every removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit, with the details set out in your service agreement before the move begins. Furniture is protected and reassembled, belongings are packed and labelled room by room, and the new home is set up so that you can sleep in your own bed on the first night.</p>
      <p>We are based in Northampton and arrange removals for older people across the whole UK, including local moves in Northamptonshire and longer moves to be closer to family, to a bungalow or to a retirement village. Packing and removals start from &pound;995 with Bronze Essentials, and a full-service move with a dedicated coordinator starts from &pound;1,850.</p>
      <div class="area-honest">
        <p>You will know the plan, the date and the price before anything is booked. A Discovery Consultation, from &pound;150, gives you a personalised timeline and budget with no obligation to go further.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

